ight=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/f1c1f50fa851086adb0771a9b2bdf371.poster.avif?t=1787327951\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/f1c1f50fa851086adb0771a9b2bdf371.webm?t=1787327951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/f1c1f50fa851086adb0771a9b2bdf371.mp4?t=1787327951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each path you take culminates in epic boss encounters where timing, adaptability, and composure are critical to survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/021f9b3d167dc2b8a5ef51fc4f05b863.avif?t=1787327951\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras_big/021f9b3d167dc2b8a5ef51fc4f05b863.webp?t=1787327951 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/2eb0c873e48e0f200099798ebff8ebd3.poster.avif?t=1787327951\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/2eb0c873e48e0f200099798ebff8ebd3.webm?t=1787327951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/2eb0c873e48e0f200099798ebff8ebd3.mp4?t=1787327951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Evolve your characters and refine your build each run, so every attempt feels fresh and challenging. Lasting meta‑progression keeps every run meaningful. Risk powerful Devil’s Bargains or tackle Operator’s Trials for high‑stakes rewards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/63aa3a0ac5a72922a6d3397b1a02c162.avif?t=1787327951\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras_big/63aa3a0ac5a72922a6d3397b1a02c162.webp?t=1787327951 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/ed88d2357e960391a10fef927c83cf7e.poster.avif?t=1787327951\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/ed88d2357e960391a10fef927c83cf7e.webm?t=1787327951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/ed88d2357e960391a10fef927c83cf7e.mp4?t=1787327951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a brutal and dark sci‑fi world where each run brings you closer to transcending your own kind. As the last A.I. created by a mysterious Operator and guided by Eden, will you find a way out?", "about_the_game": "Explore the remains of a distant dystopian future, and survive in a gritty and brutal world of high‑octane, fast‑paced hack‑and‑slash action. Each cycle reveals fragments of forgotten truth about mankind’s self‑inflicted downfall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/1c5aea6f0f87b210c771b97f04650c78.avif?t=1787327951\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras_big/1c5aea6f0f87b210c771b97f04650c78.webp?t=1787327951 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a